' The next-turn key held through a handover, two humans in a v1.2 game from
' the start screen (`menu seed 3 start 30 start2 1`). T held for 1.5 s: Anna's
' turn ends after 0.6 s; Bob's scene starts the hold again from nought
' (`OnActivateScene`), so his turn ends 0.6 s later too, while the key is
' still down. A tap after that does nothing.
menuclick 160,100        ' the intro: a click goes to the start screen (IntroScene.cs:135-139)
menuclick 60,104         ' player one's slot
type Anna
menuclick 250,104        ' player two's slot
type Bob
menuclick 163,54         ' START
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
wait 3
holdkey t 1500
wait 150
holdkey t 100
wait 30
quit
